      "message": "This setting (ANDROID_QUIET_BUILD\u003dt) is obviously aimed at the incremental development where the typical output looks like the one in the description where a build results in a single failure that almost immediately terminates it. IMHO providing an additional summary wouldn\u0027t help much in such scenario, except perhaps displaying a reminder to check the error.log",
